{
  "id": "ep42-vo-04",
  "clips": [
    {
      "name": "B1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "泥板上，吉尔伽美什失去好友，想要不死。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "B1.mp3",
      "bytes": 69006,
      "heard": "泥板上,吉尔加美食失去好友,想要不死",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.24
    },
    {
      "name": "B3",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "她后面的话，留到最后。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "B3.mp3",
      "bytes": 36823,
      "heard": "它后面的话留到最后",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.24
    },
    {
      "name": "C1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "学生问孔子：死，是怎么回事？",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "C1.mp3",
      "bytes": 57303,
      "heard": "學生問孔子,死是怎麼回事?",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.52
    },
    {
      "name": "C2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他把目光，从死，拉回了生。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "C2.mp3",
      "bytes": 53541,
      "heard": "他把目光从死拉回了生",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.995,
      "seconds": 3.28
    },
    {
      "name": "S2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "照他说，你凌晨三点那一问，问得好。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "S2.mp3",
      "bytes": 62318,
      "heard": "照他说你凌晨三点那一问问得好",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.84
    },
    {
      "name": "M2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "管着帝国的人，也不想起床。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "M2.mp3",
      "bytes": 43510,
      "heard": "管着帝国的人也不想起床",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.64
    },
    {
      "name": "F4",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一无所有的人，想着所爱，也能感到幸福。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "F4.mp3",
      "bytes": 66498,
      "heard": "一無所有的人想著所愛也能感到幸福",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.08
    },
    {
      "name": "R1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "泥板上，酒馆女主人接着说：",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "R1.mp3",
      "bytes": 46018,
      "heard": "尼板上,酒管女主人接着说。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "name": "L1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "泥板上的答案，真的和哈佛一样。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "L1.mp3",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "heard": "泥板上的答案真的和哈佛一樣",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "name": "TE",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你把“为了什么”，改成了“为了谁”。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "TE.mp3",
      "bytes": 56049,
      "heard": "你把为了什么改成了为了谁?",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.44
    },
    {
      "name": "T3",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你活着，是为了谁？",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "T3.mp3",
      "bytes": 34315,
      "heard": "你活着是为了谁",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.992,
      "seconds": 2.08
    },
    {
      "name": "BQ",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你找的那种生命，你找不到。",
      "voice": "Iqi0ix5WGtiSXX9VDZB4",
      "voice_id": "Iqi0ix5WGtiSXX9VDZB4",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "BQ.mp3",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "heard": "你找的那种生命你找不到",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.993,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "name": "RQ1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "看看那个牵着你手的孩子，",
      "voice": "Iqi0ix5WGtiSXX9VDZB4",
      "voice_id": "Iqi0ix5WGtiSXX9VDZB4",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "RQ1.mp3",
      "bytes": 40585,
      "heard": "看看那个牵着你手的孩子",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.48
    },
    {
      "name": "RQ2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "常常拥抱你的妻子。",
      "voice": "Iqi0ix5WGtiSXX9VDZB4",
      "voice_id": "Iqi0ix5WGtiSXX9VDZB4",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "RQ2.mp3",
